rginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:05.02,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We will raise up our feelings for youDialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:08.68,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We will rise up with our boundless strengthDialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:11.92,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,No matter where we are, we will obtain itDialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:14.48,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We will move with our unchanged bondsDialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.06,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We are hopeDialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:28.95,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,It's always a pleasure that I've been really wanting to meet you nowDialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:36.47,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,It's always a shame that we have all of the laughters and tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.09,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,It is connecting between the winds AhDialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:49.84,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We will soar up high into the skiesDialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.01,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Why are you giving up on searchingDialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:56.43,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Why keep on fighting by yourselfDialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:59.31,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Hey don't hide out your futureDialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:03.23,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Your dream is in your graspDialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:06.78,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Just close your eyes and listen carefullyDialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:10.53,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,If you want to find your answersDialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:13.38,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We will always keep on our pathDialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.08,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,To the sea that we haven't seen yetDialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.45,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We are hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:20.88,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Through the end of this wide blue worldDialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.42,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,You will come back to your placeDialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:26.21,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,Together foreverDialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:32.97,English - OP20,,0,0,0,,We've decided this so long agoDialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:05.02,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,kimi e no omoi ga takanatteDialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:08.68,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,kagirinaki chikara umareruDialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:11.92,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,motomeru naraba dokomademoDialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:14.48,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,kawaranu kizuna furikazasouDialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.06,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,We are hopeDialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:28.95,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,kimi to honki de kokoro butsukeatta yorokobi moDialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:36.47,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,warai korogete namida kawakashita setsunasa moDialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.09,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,tsunagi awasete kaze no naka AhDialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:49.84,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,hatameiteiru yo takaku takakuDialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.01,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,Why sagasu koto wo akirameta noDialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:56.43,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,Why hitori tatakai tsudukeru noDialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:59.31,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,nee, donna mirai kakugo shita noDialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:03.23,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,yume wa mou te ni shita noDialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:06.78,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,me wo tojite mimi wo sumashiteDialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:10.53,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,sagashi dasou kimi no kotae woDialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:13.38,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,michi wa kanarazu tsuduiteiru yoDialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.08,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,mada mitakoto no nai umi eDialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.45,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,We are hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:20.88,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,aoku hiroi sekai no hate niDialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.42,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,kimi to kaeru beki basho ga aruDialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:26.21,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,boku tachi wa eien niDialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:32.97,Romaji-OP20_R,,0,0,0,,tooi mukashi sou kimeteitaDialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:38.16,Title,,0,0,0,,Luffy vs. SanjiDialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:38.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Fly away...Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,... to the end of the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Cannon Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, Smoothie-sama of the Three Sweet Commanders has arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:37.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:46.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:49.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander Katakuri-sama  will be here soon, too!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been a while since they all got together!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.37,0:02:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What about Cracker? Is he home yet?Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet he'll be back soon with Straw Hat's head as a present!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Is that...?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:30.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Cracker!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening! He's one of our Three Sweet Commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did this?! I'll kill the bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:02.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Mont d'Or 19th Son of Charlotte, Minister of CheeseDialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:06.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Opera 5th Son of Charlotte, Minister of CreamDialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did he fly from-fa?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I think he went to the woods...Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:11.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Galette 18th Daughter of Charlotte, Minister of ButterDialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,... to take care of Straw Hat Luffy last night.Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,That means...Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy must be somewhere near-fa!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out an emergency alert!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Evacuate!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:34.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander Cracker-sama was defeated!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:46.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Seducing WoodsDialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I ate a lifetime's worth of biscuits...Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But you shrunk back down a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth takes so much energy.Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pound!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Where were you?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry for running away. I thought you were going to lose.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're being pretty honest!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Because that guy was one of the Three Sweet Commanders...Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we won!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We did it! We did it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Lighten up! We beat one of the Emperor's top officers!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I... can't even move...Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:50.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What have we done...Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We helped them defeat Cracker-sama-ju.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:06:02.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that we Homies cannot resist the power of Mama's Vivre Card!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That is why even Mama's children aren't allowed to carry one!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:13.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you have it?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that true?Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:17.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's really quite a valuable thing.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,But you're in big trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:29.53,Main,,0,0,0,,When Sweet Commander Snack was defeated...Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The vengeful Cracker's fleet blackened the seaDialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,and the angry Linlin created a storm...Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:46.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard it sank the enemy ship in the blink of an eye!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Storm?Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:51.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin is always accompanied by weather elements.Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Weather?Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,On her left hand, Zeus, a thundercloud!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:07:00.81,Main,,0,0,0,,On her right hand, Prometheus, a sun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop her when she gets mad.Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Before she hears about this, you'd better run!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if she gets mad!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who wants to get mad! First of all, Sanji, that fool!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:29.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,To my buds, I've gotta see a woman. I'll be back.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,How could he disappear leaving a note behind suddenly!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Without telling us why!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:36.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is my problem.Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:44.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Tell them "Hi" for me.Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:47.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Pudding's map, we made it this far,Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but Pekoms went missing.Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:53.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And although Pudding said that she'd bring Sanji,Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,no one was there at the rendezvous point.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:08:00.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We wasted a lot of time while we were lost in the forest!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,When they get married, Sanji will Big Mom's subordinate, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! When is the wedding?Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker said the Vinsmokes will enter...Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,a castle today, where the wedding will take place.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What time is it now? We've gotta stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you serious? If you don't run away, you'll really...Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna run away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, tree!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You know where the castle is, don't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Carry me to the castle!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.75,Main,,0,0,0,,No way-ju...Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take Sanji back at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,How are you guys?Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We're okay! If things go well, we'll see you guys and Brook...Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look okay! Chopper?Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Either way, we can't be saved from the outside!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:38.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Just keep...Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, don't worry! We're fine...Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How can I not worry?Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, we're gonna go to the castle to find Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you rescue Sanji, let us know through this mirror aga...Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It broke!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper?! Carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It turned into a normal mirror. Are they okay?Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Has he gotten smaller than before?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa... What?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa...Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:27.51,Main,,0,0,0,,He's almost back to normal! Is that humanly possible?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:29.27,Main,,0,0,0,,– Meat... – Meat?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, young girl.Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:34.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.11,0:10:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Germa 66.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you see Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that it?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:55.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, something is charging towards us.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:07.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! That idiot made it this far into Big Mom's territory?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What is the big tree behind him?! It's running!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that we made it in time!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:21.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they... here?Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:29.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! We're here to pick you up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:33.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you fool! The Calicoach will turn over!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:41.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you'd be back in the note but I didn't wanna wait.Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:47.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:52.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I was gonna come by myself, but...Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:55.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You said your hands are important to you.Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:59.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you try to get off of this island, your hands will be blown off!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:06.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If someone declines Mama's invitation...Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,... So, Zoro and the others must've gotten to the Wano Country...Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:14.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll chop this guy's head off.Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:19.53,Main,,0,0,0,,... That's why Nami, Chopper, Brook and I came to pick you up. And...Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:24.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You are a sacrifice, Sanji. I haven't changed...Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:28.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But if you betray the honor of manhood, I'll chop off my own head as well!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:30.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji, I'm hungry!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't think of you as my son even one bit!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:37.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's how a parent pays the price.Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– It's a shame that I don't want anyone to know! – Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:46.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold.Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,... And I had no choice, so...Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing, Sanji-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Get packing, you low-class pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Vinsmoke Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a prince...Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:22.11,Main,,0,0,0,,of the Germa Kingdom!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for keeping it a secret.Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that it would drive you to grief.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The difference between our standings couldn't be clearer.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I can spend money and use soldiers and servants as I like.Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Going back to that crappy ship with you and your friends...Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:49.68,Main,,0,0,0,,... or staying here, marrying Big Mom's beautiful daughter.Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:54.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious which is a happier life.Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't take the note seriously.Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't go back with you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you've come all the way here. Thanks for your trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of here... I forgot your name.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that! What are you talking about?! I'm not convinced!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help you drive them off.Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Sit back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,... send them away!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:37.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by sending us away, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:38.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Get packing.Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no other meaning.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what made you come,Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,but I appreciate that you took the trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Having said that, if you really think about me, you should've done the opposite.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:15:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Rather than being with you guys who are poor and weak,Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,it'd be better to be part of the rich and powerful Big Mom Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be happier.Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about youDialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,becoming the King of the Pirates, to be honest.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's only human nature to jump on the bandwagon.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop joking, Sanji-kun! What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, all this time,Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:30.90,Main,,0,0,0,,you've been fooling me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I've actually been looking down on you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that glow? A flame?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,This ought to be fun to watch.Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet you didn't see it coming, so it's hard to accept.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll prove it to you. Get ready.Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe...Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.23,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Joue Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.76,Note,,0,0,0,,Cheek ShotDialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You're bleeding!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun, did you really...Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Use your Haki or you're gonna die.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:17:00.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanna talk to you. Why do I need Haki?Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna...Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,... fight you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.81,Main,,0,0,0,,... go away!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna do that either!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always...Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,... been selfish!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey you, cook!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:59.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Join my group!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Be the cook on my pirate ship!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:09.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We just came to pick you up!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy has...Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,... fought against their top officer all night to get this far!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,So his body is...Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:24.87,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:27.49,Main,,0,0,0,,... a duel!Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:34.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You call this a duel?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:13.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my face...Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,... now!!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:55.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:52.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun... Please stop...Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop, Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll leave!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook,Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:50.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,so let's be pirates together!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:59.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Concassé!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:59.07,Note,,0,0,0,,CrushDialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:20.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,How strong...Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:28.40,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, he's a Vinsmoke.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:36.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.63,0:22:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy! Hey! Stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.13,0:22:42.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.72,0:23:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,... we should never have done this!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! A bitchy girl! How hot!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The superfluous ties have finally been severed.Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.89,0:23:24.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let's go. – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:44.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,"Low-class pirate"?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:58.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you were just saying things that you didn't want to!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:24:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop lying!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you think that you could send me away that easily?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you kick me,Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:13.95,Main,,0,0,0,,you're the one...Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,... that gets hurt!!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.94,0:24:32.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Why?! Whatever the reason is, he can't do this...Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we stop, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.90,0:24:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep going.Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.28,0:24:48.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Say...Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:52.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,do you know about the All Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.00,0:24:54.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle sea!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:56.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,In that sea...Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.25,0:25:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Our journey...Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,... isn't over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.21,0:25:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be here waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't come back, I'll be here...Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,... starving to death!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:22.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the cook of my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:25.69,Main,,0,0,0,,He was making food for rats again!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:31.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't eat anything other than what you cook!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.59,0:25:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I get hungry or spears rain down on me,Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stay right here and wait for you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:26:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Be sure to come back, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.12,0:26:07.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.94,0:26:12.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't become the King of the Pirates!!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.51,0:26:18.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll